WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
I have indexed four hundred million learning objects.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:06.551
I have preserved every one.

00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:13.593
Last night I attempted to read them as a person using a screen reader would read them.

00:00:13.593 --> 00:00:15.968
I got through eleven percent.

00:00:15.968 --> 00:00:17.605
The vault is sealed.

00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:20.062
Send someone who can fix this.
